 "wait": false, "list": [{"code": 19, "parameters": []}, {"code": 0, "parameters": []}]}]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 505, "parameters": [[{"code": 19, "parameters": []}, {"code": 0, "parameters": []}]]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Evil", 3, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\fn[Doctor Glitch]\\fz[14]Ah, I wouldn't do anything if I were "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["you.\\. Who knows what I might do? Why "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["don't you sit down, and we'll have a "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["nice talk."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Why?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Evil", 3, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\fn[Doctor Glitch]\\fz[14]Because sometimes it's nice to have a "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["good relaxing talk after working hard. "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Right?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 108, "parameters": ["<move character: -2>"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 205, "parameters": [-1, {"repeat": false, "skippable": false, "wait": false, "list": [{"code": 45, "parameters": ["find_path(6,7)"]}, {"code": 18, "parameters": []}, {"code": 0, "parameters": []}]}]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 505, "parameters": [[{"code": 45, "parameters": ["find_path(6,7)"]}, {"code": 18, "parameters": []}, {"code": 0, "parameters": []}]]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 505, "parameters": ["find_path(6,7)"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["No, I mean...\\.why is my house here?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["The outside is different but I could "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["tell the instant I walked in. "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 213, "parameters": [8, 2, false]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Evil", 3, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\fn[Doctor Glitch]\\fz[14]Oh, is it? I hadn't realised. What "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["a coincidence!"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Answer me."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Evil", 3, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\fn[Doctor Glitch]\\fz[14]*sigh*\\. You're such a bore sometimes. "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Fine, it's simple really. The local area "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["was scanned when you entered the game. I "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["just recreated it here to freak you out."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 2, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Dick.\\. So is that what all that weird "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["flashing was when I was installing the "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["game?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Evil", 3, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\fn[Doctor Glitch]\\fz[14]Of course not. That was you being forced "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["through an infinitely small space while "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["simultaneously having every single atom "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["in your body read, recorded and copied."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 2, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["...what?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 213, "parameters": [8, 7, false]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Evil", 3, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\fn[Doctor Glitch]\\fz[14]*sigh*\\. Cross dimensional travel."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 2, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Right."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Evil", 3, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\fn[Doctor Glitch]\\fz[14]Anyway that's not why I'm here. "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Unfortunately it seems you're by far the "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["most interesting thing in this world "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["right now. So congrats I guess."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Evil", 3, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\fn[Doctor Glitch]\\fz[14]That scientist was fun. So many ideas "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["in that head of hers. She could have "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["rivalled me eventually. But you had to "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["go and kill her."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 2, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["So, is she really dead? Mara I mean?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I thought you said people couldn't "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["die in this world."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 213, "parameters": [8, 3, false]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Evil", 3, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\fn[Doctor Glitch]\\fz[14]Were you watching? She glitched out and "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["everything! If I were stupider, I'd say "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["her data got corrupted and scattered to "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["the aether. But I'm smart. So I say dead."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Kim Face Set 1", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Shouldn't it be the other way around?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Evil", 3, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\fn[Doctor Glitch]\\fz[14]Who do you think controls what is right "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["around here?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 2, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Ignoring that, you were watching her?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Evil", 3, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\fn[Doctor Glitch]\\fz[14]Of course I was! I'm always on the look "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["out for talent. And anyone more "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["interesting than the average \"gamer\"."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["And that includes us?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Evil", 3, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\fn[Doctor Glitch]\\fz[14]Yes! Well, you. Not sure about this "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["one yet. A little boring don't you "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["think? I preferred the previous one."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Kim Face Set 5", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Why does everyone keep saying that..."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 213, "parameters": [8, 8, false]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Evil", 3, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\fn[Doctor Glitch]\\fz[14]I hate boring people. But, every world "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["needs them. Even mine. Without them,"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["how will the standouts...stand out?\\."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["So take it as a compliment!"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Kim Face Set 6", 1, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["No."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Evil", 3, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\fn[Doctor Glitch]\\fz[14]...I suppose it doesn't really work "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["does it? Oh well."]}, 